    "name": "Warehouse API",
    "description": "Inventory endpoints for office supply catalog, stock snapshots, and stock transactions. Run prerequisites: dotnet run --project DevTools seed-warehouse and dotnet run --project DevTools seed-warehouse-admin, then run this collection. The employee and admin requests register their accounts first, then log in; tokens are stored as collection variables. Repeat runs reuse the existing item type when the seeded type already exists, and create new items (Item.Name has no unique index).",
